    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventurer's Gate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient portals open the doors to mysterious worlds. From the peaceful village of Aorilys, you explore parallel dimensions inhabited by legendary creatures, in search of runes and powerful artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each adventure brings you closer to the villagers while revealing the secrets of the eight dungeons. Find monster runes to summon powerful allies, equip yourself with fairy runes, and upgrade your arsenal with items recovered from your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>A Living Village:</strong> Interact with twenty NPCs, each with their own quests, stories, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Portals to the Unknown:</strong> Explore parallel worlds, face legendary creatures, and discover forgotten artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f <strong>Evolving Rune System:</strong> Collect monster, fairy, and enhancement runes to customize your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Eight Epic Dungeons:</strong> Take on unique challenges and face formidable bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0e <strong>A Rich and Immersive World:</strong> Each portal leads to a new adventure, with its own challenges and rewards.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventurer's Gate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient portals open the doors to mysterious worlds. From the peaceful village of Aorilys, you explore parallel dimensions inhabited by legendary creatures, in search of runes and powerful artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each adventure brings you closer to the villagers while revealing the secrets of the eight dungeons. Find monster runes to summon powerful allies, equip yourself with fairy runes, and upgrade your arsenal with items recovered from your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>A Living Village:</strong> Interact with twenty NPCs, each with their own quests, stories, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Portals to the Unknown:</strong> Explore parallel worlds, face legendary creatures, and discover forgotten artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f <strong>Evolving Rune System:</strong> Collect monster, fairy, and enhancement runes to customize your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Eight Epic Dungeons:</strong> Take on unique challenges and face formidable bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0e <strong>A Rich and Immersive World:</strong> Each portal leads to a new adventure, with its own challenges and rewards.</p>",
